  "npcs": [
    {
      "entry": 18318,
      "name": "Sethekk Initiate",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18318:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:847c0a77ea288a1d8d933a93",
            "source:dd8921a4ba2220960af89a3b",
            "source:094502d0e1a3fa016d7b9c12",
            "source:a3043dc7f621ca6da408816a",
            "source:b7cf2c97b09770d827c46e77"
          ],
          "text": "A Sethekk Initiate in Sethekk Halls, this Arakkoa warrior answers threats with calls invoking Terokk, the Veil, and vengeance for Darkfire. The repeated battle cries place the Initiate among the defenders of the Veil and its cause.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18318
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18319,
      "name": "Time-Lost Scryer",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18319:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:ca0586a94f73fdf83e08640b",
            "source:0ef58c30599b185dbeb573b3",
            "source:3fb54b23c006a3c0a8373c04",
            "source:a7e43e5ec9602bfcd70f3cca",
            "source:e6f2ecbd7a97ce36b5dd4b9c",
            "source:75382ee5f4e95d57a609af58"
          ],
          "text": "A Time-Lost Scryer among the Sethekk Halls Arakkoa, this creature's battle calls invoke Terokk, the Veil, and vengeance for Darkfire. Its role is bound to defending the Veil; it also casts Arcane Destruction while out of combat.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18319
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18320,
      "name": "Time-Lost Shadowmage",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18320:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:83f825f92baa3232a30fce7d",
            "source:884846a34ee804d54b45c719",
            "source:01c7b366f5953b92b133664a",
            "source:3817fe82562d23644c87d197",
            "source:58adeaa67a65881bf1cca492"
          ],
          "text": "A Time-Lost Shadowmage of Sethekk Halls, this Arakkoa creature's battle calls invoke Terokk, the Veil, and vengeance for Darkfire. These repeated cries place the Shadowmage among the Veil's defenders, fighting for the cause its words affirm.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18320
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18321,
      "name": "Sethekk Talon Lord",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18321:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:82a49e0c3f2c9407b932abe6",
            "source:2ca97bd9c5eddfa4f7653016",
            "source:2b4f7730467c5ba32a3f9e44",
            "source:7f3565080c2dc17b8e4d75c1",
            "source:f0827ffca3ec1fc0d7d82951"
          ],
          "text": "A Sethekk Talon Lord in Sethekk Halls, this Arakkoa warrior joins the defense of the Veil. Its battle calls invoke Terokk and call for vengeance for Darkfire, expressing allegiance to the cause it fights to protect.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18321
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18322,
      "name": "Sethekk Ravenguard",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18322:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:47a68418ea0f1f03a71a7f8c",
            "source:17ec6e0aac37307ce239fd6c",
            "source:0674adf645b7663c45306f0b",
            "source:5126228cec6676c0861dbe49",
            "source:7337e719c326cae0dcc9b1a5",
            "source:cf5895e776b734b571a63225",
            "source:0c78a31c7099f49a509c0f4f",
            "source:0f42756f56b26a338fde0b18"
          ],
          "text": "A Sethekk Ravenguard in Sethekk Halls, this Arakkoa warrior fights for Terokk's cause and the defense of the Veil. Its cries call for vengeance for Darkfire, while it uses Bloodthirst in combat.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18322
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18323,
      "name": "Sethekk Guard",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18323:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:1821e09c0e6868968868c137",
            "source:037460e55de4c826b233a0ba",
            "source:c8224462b6a89eeb053cf923",
            "source:4ead9ab1485f641f5a92ac4a",
            "source:de1085f7f1909875708f18a8"
          ],
          "text": "A Sethekk Guard stationed in Sethekk Halls, this Arakkoa warrior fights for Terokk's cause and the defense of the Veil. Its battle calls also demand vengeance for Darkfire, marking the cause it serves among the Sethekk.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18323
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18325,
      "name": "Sethekk Prophet",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18325:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:4c6e7c21f958ad76108da2a1",
            "source:69675573c5191833e7c58f6a",
            "source:fc9dc8be0f3b8880dbf62028",
            "source:d843eca2a69de145a556117a"
          ],
          "text": "A Sethekk Prophet guards the Halls in the name of Terokk, calling for the Veil to be protected and for Darkfire to be avenged. Its shared battle cries frame it as one of the Halls' defenders.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18325
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18326,
      "name": "Sethekk Shaman",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18326:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:7c7064408d9d7cfd8342b9f7",
            "source:87101dcb6daa57a36cf7ced5",
            "source:4e6d862f0b374c9908f00c1f",
            "source:7a8fc6385b0f1a6831f336ef"
          ],
          "text": "A Sethekk Shaman defends the Halls under Terokk's name, urging protection of the Veil and vengeance for Darkfire. Its battle cries match those of the other Sethekk defenders.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18326
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18327,
      "name": "Time-Lost Controller",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18327:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:6d88d8698f491480c4fd9760",
            "source:6ad7872b7e99a44a058a7cc2",
            "source:a85f11e29acbfd12566bad11",
            "source:7306d7dc14029a2d129701ba",
            "source:d0bcc9e8582500b6aebe1868",
            "source:2679dfd1ab179e011c150297",
            "source:c495f6891b0e3a31b32ba154"
          ],
          "text": "The Time-Lost Controller is a Sethekk Halls defender whose cries invoke Terokk, the Veil and vengeance for Darkfire, alongside distinct Arakkoa-like calls. In combat it summons a Charming Totem.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18327
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18328,
      "name": "Sethekk Oracle",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18328:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:532f872be32120a0728cc1b1",
            "source:64e3a63e7d713a767d2a19d5",
            "source:b6225c9fd53ce5ae991b8da2",
            "source:38502d5e352f708fb384ae25"
          ],
          "text": "A Sethekk Oracle defends the Halls in Terokk's name, calling for the Veil's protection and vengeance for Darkfire. Its cries share the defensive refrain heard from other Sethekk guards.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18328
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18472,
      "name": "Darkweaver Syth",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18472:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:6f4bb04a2777557041712684",
            "source:4eaaa371801e9ddb4bfbf368",
            "source:33d37788b2c3fba0921466cd",
            "source:6f81a6f9867e43c406459111",
            "source:8a890c1301c7e092c43299c9",
            "source:846ed04e80eb15ee6402774a",
            "source:7e670c6890160a9e8af3e229",
            "source:e1c0f59686a2eb9dbc8c06a6"
          ],
          "text": "Darkweaver Syth is a Sethekk leader who taunts opponents with birdlike cries and boasts that he has pets of his own. He calls the enemy's companions nice pets, then mocks their weapons; his remarks about fleeting life and freedom cast his fighting as bound up with release. His brother Isfar says Syth cast him out but kept their sister Lakka captive, giving Syth a direct family conflict beyond his role in the Halls.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18472
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18473,
      "name": "Talon King Ikiss",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18473:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:ec2bd0c4d958a9764a87e371",
            "source:8abcbb12dbd2e912d80e3534",
            "source:82ae2876628ffc7ed7cb0b78",
            "source:defe3ccf7ed956873468413a",
            "source:990d2ebee42d39c1e098635d",
            "source:a45c35ea7c871063df7f2761"
          ],
          "text": "Talon King Ikiss is a Sethekk Halls boss whose broken, birdlike speech fixates on pretty trinkets and the power he believes they hold. He threatens intruders and warns them away from his trinkets.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18473
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 18956,
      "name": "Lakka",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:18956:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:83ec23fd4d946c201cccd271",
            "source:65efdd0276c64ff6ddb00a12",
            "source:f3ceff7ba4f7c88ec1d5b96f"
          ],
          "text": "Lakka is held in a cage in the Sethekk Halls and asks to be freed, urging the listener to kill her brother Darkweaver Syth. After being freed, she says she will make her way to Shattrath.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 18956
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
